The '''Stride-Ember Fissure''' is a sub-location of the [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Features ==
The '''Stride-Ember Fissure''' is a large pool of lava with several steppingstones scattered around. {{MobSprite|Stridersurfer;Stridersurfers}} wander about the fissure. Additionally, they can be fished up upon reaching {{skill|Fishing|17}}.

The '''Stride-Ember Fissure''' can be accessed through the {{Zone|Side-Ember Way}} in the {{Zone|North Wetlands}} or the {{Zone|Dive-Ember Pass}} in the {{Zone|Murkwater Depths}}.

